/*
  DrivingTips.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0168 · DrivingTips (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DrivingTips` resolves (table "DrivingTips") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/DrivingTips.tsx) — the panel title plus
  every recommendation string passed to `t(key, default)`. The second group backs the
  native chrome: the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error copy, so the Swift sources hold
  no English prose literals.
*/

